 "what": "Developers we track whose published name matches a listed company exactly (legal-form endings aside): exchange, ticker, the official place to read filings, and for SEC filers the latest annual report. No share prices, no advice.",
 "method": [
  "Each developer name as published is compared with company names in Wikidata items that have a stock exchange statement, in the SEC EDGAR company list, and in the official company lists of the Australian Securities Exchange and of KAP (Borsa Istanbul). Only exact matches, ignoring legal-form endings such as PJSC, PLC, PCL, Bhd, Inc., Ltd, A.S., are kept, then checked by hand; same-name companies in another business were removed.",
  "Subsidiaries and joint ventures with a different name are not matched, so a developer missing here may still belong to a listed group.",
  "Filing links go to the company page on the exchange or regulator where that page could be checked, else to the official site of the exchange.",
  "Latest annual report: forms 10-K, 20-F or 40-F from the SEC EDGAR submissions API."
 ],
